    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;In Her Head&quot;</strong> - a captivating visual novel that offers players a unique glimpse into the daily struggles of the main character with social anxiety. Immerse yourself in her inner world, where anxiety, procrastination, and unease are constant companions. In this visual novel, you will experience several days in her life, with the central challenge being a single task \u2014 making a phone call to schedule a haircut. But what is it like when every call feels like a trial? Help her overcome her fears and take this step.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>4 Endings: Your decisions impact the storyline's outcome.<br>Dive into her mind: Explore the main character's inner world through her thoughts and internal dialogue.<br>Stylish visual design: Enhances the game's atmosphere.<br>Sound design that accentuates emotions and the character's states.<br>Unusual immersion into the world of inner struggles.<br><br>The game addresses the timely topic of mental health.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;In Her Head&quot;</strong> - a captivating visual novel that offers players a unique glimpse into the daily struggles of the main character with social anxiety. Immerse yourself in her inner world, where anxiety, procrastination, and unease are constant companions. In this visual novel, you will experience several days in her life, with the central challenge being a single task \u2014 making a phone call to schedule a haircut. But what is it like when every call feels like a trial? Help her overcome her fears and take this step.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>4 Endings: Your decisions impact the storyline's outcome.<br>Dive into her mind: Explore the main character's inner world through her thoughts and internal dialogue.<br>Stylish visual design: Enhances the game's atmosphere.<br>Sound design that accentuates emotions and the character's states.<br>Unusual immersion into the world of inner struggles.<br><br>The game addresses the timely topic of mental health.",
    "short_description": "This is a short visual novel that immerses the player in the inner world of the main character, who suffers from social anxiety and is afraid even of a simple phone call. Experience with her the anxiety, procrastination, and constant struggle with herself.",
